c0: seq 0 Etb mime [] no text, no bytes
c1: seq 1 eTb mime [text/plain] text hello, no bytes
c2: seq 2 etB mime [image/png] no text, bytes 3 sum 31
c3: seq 3 Etb mime [] no text, no bytes
c4: seq 4 eTb mime [text/plain] text again, no bytes
c1 after: seq 1 eTb mime [text/plain] text hello, no bytes
